# The top square of loft_profiles.tlspr lofted to the bottom one, picked
# with the mouse, its ends set on its screen; the same as
# path_loft_tangency.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/loft_tangency, roadmap
# 28.3).
file $testdata/ui/loft_profiles.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 300 400
down L 300 400
up L 300 400
menu Features|Loft To Selected Profile
twmove 236 185
twdown L 236 185
twup L 236 185
edit 1
twmove 236 205
twdown L 236 205
twup L 236 205
edit 0.5
